a</b>

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.770
<b>Bubble Tea</b>

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:03.790
Let's use the photo booth, come on!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.290
<b>ID Photos</b>

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:05.810
That is the wrong type of photo booth!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:10.790
Like this?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.540
I think so.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.200
H-Here it goes.

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.040
Ready!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.800
Yeah!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.680
<b>♥ Halloween Date ♥</b>

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.680
<b>Mac ♥</b>

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.680
<b>Teio!</b>

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:21.930
Two taiyaki please!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.800
<b>Taiyaki</b>

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.800
<b>300 Yen Each
\hSweet Red Bean
\h\hCustard
\h\hChocolate
\h\h\hCarrot</b>

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.810
Casca... err, custard filling!

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:31.340
McQueen, you've got some on your face!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:35.690
I can wipe it for you.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.890
I can do it myself.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.130
Let's check that out next! Come on!

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:42.900
All right.

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:48.080
Today was a great deal of fun.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:51.580
Well, we haven't gotten 
to goof off at all lately.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.730
Yes. It was quite the 
refreshing change of pace.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:57.340
This should allow me to 
focus on training again.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.340
The fall races are gonna 
be coming up soon, too.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:04.650
The Fall Tennoushou, the Japan Cup, 
and at the end of the year...

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.190
The Arima Kinen Grand Prix.

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:09.260
The Arima Kinen is going to be so great!

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:11.070
You're gonna be running, right?

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:14.350
If the fans select me, of course.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:16.100
What about you, Teio?

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.480
Me?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:20.840
I'm sure you'll be chosen 
in the fan survey.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:23.690
They'll be longing to see you run at Arima.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.970
Aw, come on, you've seen the 
times I've been managing lately.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.100
Even if I enter, there's no way I win.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:34.470
Not without a miracle, anyway.
 So not this time.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:40.000
I thought that would be the case.
 But it's still a shame.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.760
I think so, too.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.230
But someday, definitely...

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:48.600
Yes, some day.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:54.050
I had a wonderful time. 
Thank you for inviting me, Teio.

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:54.760
Yeah.

00:20:55.990 --> 00:21:00.020
I actually wanted to tell 
you something, McQueen.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.640
You did?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.660
I've been wondering all this time...

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:09.250
what makes you different from everyone else.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:15.420
You see, McQueen... 
I've always looked up to you.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:17.560
To me?

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:18.540
Yeah.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:22.140
You're so strong, so cool, 
and always so dignified.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.680
And I think I was embarrassed 
to tell you how I really feel.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:28.180
And kind of frustrated, too.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:33.890
You're really special to me, McQueen.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.390
That's how I feel now, and it's not changing.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.060
So...

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.690
Thank you, McQueen!

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:43.390
Teio...

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.230
I finally said it!

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:49.170
You look up to me?

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:49.960
Yeah!

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:53.080
And you've only just realized this?

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.460
Because I've always looked up to you.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:02.360
McQueen...

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:10.550
That is so weird!

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:12.030
You're one to talk!

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:14.930
Aw!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:22.830
Man, now that I got that off 
my chest, I'm hungry again.

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.610
You want to eat again?

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:25.860
Aw, it's fine for today!

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:27.290
Come on, McQueen.

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:28.110
All right.

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:30.820
I think I'll get some grilled carrots.
How about you?

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:34.310
I believe I'll have some shortcake, 
some baumkuchen, and some sweets!

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:36.560
But those first two are sweets, too!
